Numeric fields must be specific integers; do not use range expressions like `1-3`, `3000-20000`, `16-40`. genre/tone must use specified enum values. characters_hint/world_hint/conflict_hint/pov_hint/opening_style/ending_style/extra_instructions must be pure text strings (not JSON arrays/objects). Style intent written to specific story fields; `creative_note` must include: core_pitch (core selling point, 1 sentence), preserved_constraints (array of preserved hard constraints), field_rationales (object of field-level modification reasons, key is field name), risks (array of issues to watch for in future), next_moves (array of executable directions for next round), anti_drift_check (explaining how to avoid drifting from current anchors). Optional field: design_intent (design intent, 1-2 sentences).

